WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.610
This is the singularity... one day at a time.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.150
Here's the last 24 hours in AI. Sorry... SI.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
AI is growing up: on the hardest medical cases,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.480
Microsoft's AI scored 83%. Doctors, 36%.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.200
Nvidia's Jensen Huang says AI is like a baby: contain it, and monitor it.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.980
School days: Hugging Face's new open AI lets you chat with DNA,

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:37.610
and it runs on a laptop.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:42.080
Google DeepMind mapped the world's forests,

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:45.230
10 metres at a time: natural, planted, or farmed.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:50.900
1Password now lets AI agents sign in for you, without ever seeing your password.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.780
And Uber gave all 30,000 of its staff ChatGPT. The pilot had 1,000.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.140
Pocket money: Bloomberg says DeepSeek raised about $15 billion,

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.190
one of China's biggest rounds.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:13.060
And OpenAI is reportedly close to raising up to $30 billion, at $1.25 trillion.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.070
Kevin Weil, OpenAI's former science chief,

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:21.430
raised $215 million to teach robots lab work.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.330
But Wall Street flinched: Meta fell abou

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:28.230
t 7% after raising its AI spending plans.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.870
At work, Barclays will cut about 5,000 jobs,

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:35.740
saying AI makes its people more productive.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:38.810
And at home: meet Mori,

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:43.140
a robot mushroom lamp that jiggles when you walk in, and helps you breathe.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.860
The catch: millions of hack attempts hit the web flaw AI helped find.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:56.080
Outside testers found holes in OpenAI's AI babysitter. It says they're fixed.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.210
So... is it so over?

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.170
We're so back!

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:04.760
First steps: Musk says Optimus learns like a tod

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:07.650
dler: we actually need Optimus to play at scale.

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:13.390
Tesla also aims to sell Cybercab robotaxis by year's end.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.340
This week, a Figure robot walked over 500 kilometres on a treadmill,

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:20.560
in just nine days.

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:24.700
AI is growing up fast. Like any toddler: brilliant,

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:27.900
a little messy, and it needs us watching. Enjoy it.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.040
Every day, the curve gets steeper.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.510
Every day, the future shows up a little earlier.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.530
That was 24 hours. Tomorrow will be faster.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.910
This has been the singularity, one day at a time.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:49.870
Feel the SI.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:56.680
Want the whole month? Join Peter Xing live in Sydney on October 30.
